cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SPAR
message: If you use SPAR, please cite this repository.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Vij
    given-names: Madhavan
  - name: "SP Jain School of Global Management, AI in Finance Group 3"
abstract: >-
  SPAR (Scenario Planning via Agentic Reasoning) is a multi-LLM debate system
  for geopolitical financial stress testing. Five specialist models debate a
  shock; a separate validator synthesises consensus and dissent; a factor model
  produces VaR and a hedge overlay.
keywords:
  - multi-agent
  - large language models
  - debate
  - financial stress testing
  - geopolitics
